e; a group is an ongoing matter, a company's own financial lines carry none\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2324:## D166 · 2026-10-25 · Group identity and membership by names, in code\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2330:## D167 · 2026-10-25 · No hard-coded identity for aggregates; the judge gets the evidence, the vocabulary gets the missing measures, the writer owns replacement\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2338:## D168 · 2026-10-25 · Four corrections found by the D167 measurement: one repeat rule, one replace definition, one succession rule, one missing answer\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2346:## D169 · 2026-10-25 · Jev is the default matching engine\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2353:## D170 · 2026-10-25 · Phase close-out: what the code review removed, fixed and left\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2360:## D171 · 2026-10-25 · Review and free proofs for the day-batch acceleration proposal\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2369:## D172 · 2026-10-25 · Build the isolated ordered-concurrency POC\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2376:## D173 · 2026-10-25 · Isolated provider smoke before a larger concurrency test\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2383:## D174 · 2026-10-25 · Three-document end-to-end concurrency diagnostic\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2390:## D175 · 2026-10-25 · Publish sequential cleanup separately from experiments\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2395:## D176 · 2026-10-25 · Judge business-question coverage, not mandatory project cards\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2401:## D177 · 2026-10-25 · Modify and test NAVER admission on one frozen context\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2410:## D178 · 2026-10-25 · Resume the isolated acceleration POC with the tested T6 role\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2420:## D179 · 2026-10-25 · Roll back the unrelated extraction prerequisite\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2428:## D180 · 2026-10-25 · Execute the existing implementation plan on the complete busy day\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2437:## D181 · 2026-10-26 · The parallel day, measured end to end on live APIs, and promoted as an opt-in replay mode\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2447:## D182 · 2026-10-26 · The parallel day over fifteen consecutive days, against the serial path, with no network\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2456:## D183 · 2026-10-26 · The replay runs the parallel day by default\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2464:## D184 · 2026-10-26 · A candidate thesis opens for one of four reasons, stated in the answer\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2472:## D185 · 2026-10-26 · A binding obligation is due within 18 months and is exempt from the next-year rule\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2476:## D186 · 2026-10-26 · Asset-thesis rungs describe business outcomes; the favourable end is registered per thesis\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2480:## D187 · 2026-10-26 · A company's own quantity sits under that company's object, private companies included\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2484:## D188 · 2026-10-26 · The extraction gold: twenty cases labelled by the assistant this round, human review later\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2488:## D189 · 2026-10-26 · poc-v25 is the replay default; the trace review names the next mechanisms\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2493:## D190 · 2026-10-26 · The collision judge: Jev for identity, the generative model for the analyst's question when a question may be held twice\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2503:## D191 · 2026-10-26 · Theme theses reach every company; no named dependant is required to open one\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2512:## D192 · 2026-10-26 · Role v13 (tests instead of lists) fails its probe; wording is exhausted as a lever\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2521:## D193 · 2026-10-26 · Extraction coverage is at the model's steady state; the phase closes on v12 with the collision judge\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2527:## D194 · 2026-10-26 · The six persistent misses read against the transcripts: one gold key removed, five stand\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2538:## D195 · 2026-10-26 · The theme block: every asset thesis is judged with the open theme theses in view, and a changed theme conclusion reaches them in the same round\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2546:## D196 · 2026-10-27 · `poc-v29` (the theme block) is the replay default\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2551:## D197 · 2026-10-27 · A shared quantity is one thesis per theme, measure and period; its wording is not identity\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2559:## D198 · 2026-10-27 · A judgement reads the evidence in view, not everything in force\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2568:## D199 · 2026-10-27 · One extraction call stays; its gate rule becomes decidable and the empty-answer exit goes (v16, poc-v32)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2577:## D200 · 2026-10-27 · Extraction v18 (`poc-v34`) is the production default\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2585:## D201 · 2026-10-27 · Steps 3 and 4: Jev gives opinions only, the library keeps sources and research arguments, a new question needs an independent investment judgement; gold first, small scope, root cause before any change\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2594:## D202 · 2026-10-27 · The writer retires nothing on a matching label: a replacement is recorded as a revision and both pieces stay in force\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2602:## D203 · 2026-10-28 · A statement day is an ISO day or unknown; the writer never fills it with the publication day\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2610:## D204 · 2026-10-28 · A repeat is stored as its own source record; the merge becomes a labelled relation\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2618:## D205 · 2026-10-28 · The judging call's output budget is 16,000 tokens\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2625:## D206 · 2026-10-28 · Every open theme thesis is shown to every item's extraction (extraction v19, `poc-v35`)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2631:## D207 · 2026-10-28 · Statements are filed by a separate placement call under the one-home rule; an unfiled statement is kept (extraction v20, `poc-v36`)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2638:## D208 · 2026-10-28 · The thesis tree: root quantities, a seeded driver layer per company, shared macro themes with declared channels (design, not built)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2644:## D209 · 2026-10-28 · A statement no open question takes is dropped at extraction; evaluation reads the dropped record, not a side list\n