flection round 26)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:6432:## D536 · 2026-11-15 · Under D439: no measurement of the reversed reading direction is sent now; next, at $0, size where dependency selection could act in the stored unseeded fresh week (council consensus, reflection round 27)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:6457:## D537 · 2026-11-15 · Under D439: the dependency-selection census has one clear case and negative controls; before any send, the edge's effect on filing and judging is proved on stored data (council consensus, reflection round 28)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:6479:## D538 · 2026-11-15 · Under D439: one dependency edge shows the intended conclusion to the judge and removes seven filing links; the dependency slice's design is opened at $0, beginning with the separation of the edge's two uses (council consensus, reflection round 29)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:6504:## D539 · 2026-11-15 · Under D439: the separation of a dependency edge's two uses is kept as a candidate, not yet the builder's contract; its design continues at $0 (council consensus, reflection round 30)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:6525:## D540 · 2026-11-15 · Under D439: the separation stays a provisional research candidate; the filing and duplicate-label contracts are finished at $0 before any selection design or send (council consensus, reflection round 31)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:6544:## D541 · 2026-11-15 · Under D439: the seed edge's label stops everything that touches a seed edge; the filing finding is bounded; the unseeded failure-and-reader contract is finished at $0 before the separation is called sound (council consensus, reflection round 32)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:6566:## D542 · 2026-11-15 · Under D439: the dependency stretch is closed with the separation recorded as a provisional candidate; the status is consolidated; nothing is sent (council consensus, reflection round 33)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:6589:## D543 · 2026-11-15 · Under D439: the cold reflection on the lean path: D518 stands with its reasons, the choice o