it once a\nPASS  S7 cycle: caught: FAIL  A2  a cycle through rests_on (S7)  [expected S7; got pass]  []\nPASS  S7 value or range: caught: FAIL  A2  value with low (S7)  [expected S7; got pass]  []\nPASS  S7 source basis: caught: FAIL  A2  a source with basis forecast (S7)  [expected S7; got S4]  [[\"S4\", \"NVIDIA | revenue | company | FY2027 Q3: 2 forecasts (F3, F4); compute it once and u\nPASS  S7 unresolved shape: caught: FAIL  A2  a marker on an unresolved member (S7)  [expected S7; got pass]  []\nPASS  S8 part into whole: caught: FAIL  A2  Data Center added into company in one sum (S8)  [expected S8; got S4]  [[\"S4\", \"NVIDIA | revenue | company | FY2027: 2 forecasts (BAD, F6); compute it\nPASS  S8 periods: caught: FAIL  A2  Q2 + Q3 labelled H1 (S8)  [expected S8; got pass]  []\nPASS  S8 period spelling: caught: FAIL  A3  \"FY2027 first half\" summed from quarters  [expected S8; got pass]  []\nPASS  recorded conversion: caught: FAIL  A1  a conversion between quantities (recorded, not refused)  [expected pass + recorded conversion between quantities; got pass]  [\"missing recorded conver\n29 of 29 as expected (control + 28 mutants)\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
