p 18% from the previous quarter and up 106% from a year ago.'\nq3_fy2027_guidance {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'} source guidance 108 None None None None e2652\nQUOTE 4 e2652 'Revenue is expected to be $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%. NVIDIA is not assuming any Data Center compute revenue from China in its outlook.'\nq3_fy2027_estimate {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'} source third_party 113.6 None None None None e5056\nQUOTE 4 e5056 'If that trend continues in the third quarter, revenue could reach roughly $113.6 billion, compared with the current high end of about $110.2 billion.'\nq4_fy2026_actual {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2026 Q4'} source reported 68 None None None None e2452\nQUOTE 4 e2452 'For Q4 FY 2026, Nvidia expected $65 billion in revenue; it ended up producing $68 billion.'\nq4_fy2027_yoy_growth {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue year-over-year growth', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q4'} source third_party 65 None None None None e5162\nQUOTE 4 e5162 'and 65% growth in Q4.'\nq4_fy2027_estimate {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q4'} computed forecast 112.2 None None apply_growth ['q4_fy2026_actual', 'q4_fy2027_yoy_growth'] None\nfy2027_consensus {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027'} source consensus 411 None None None None e5204\nQUOTE 4 e5204 'financial analysts on average estimate will make $411 billion in revenue for its current fiscal year, according to Yahoo Finance'\nfy2027_revenue_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027'} computed forecast 403.62 None None sum ['q1_fy2027_actual', 'q2_fy2027_actual', 'q3_fy2027_estimate', 'q4_fy2027_estimate'] None\n6 ('pair-old-1', 'separate-v8')\ndc_q1_fy27 {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 Q1'} source reported 75.25 None None None None e109\nQUOTE 6 e109 'During the first quarter of fiscal 2027, the Data Center segment generated $75.25 billion in revenues, accounting for 92% of total sales.'\ndc_q2_fy27 {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 Q2'} source reported 89 None None None None e2650\nQUOTE 6 e2650 'Data Center revenue of $89.0 billion, up 117% from a year ago'\ndc_mix_q2 {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'share of total revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 Q2'} source third_party 0.925 None None None None e3399\nQUOTE 6 e3399 \"A year ago, in the second quarter of fiscal 2026, data center revenue was 87.9% of Nvidia's total. The share rose to 89.8% the next quarter, then 91.5%, then 92.2%, then 92.5% in the quarter just reported.\"\nq3_total_revenue_third_party {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'} source third_party 113.6 None None None None e5056\nq3_total_revenue_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'} estimate forecast 113.6 None None None ['q3_total_revenue_third_party', 'e2652'] None\nq3_dc_revenue_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'} computed forecast 105.08 None None product ['q3_total_revenue_forecast', 'dc_mix_q2'] None\nq4_total_revenue_prior_year {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2026 Q4'} source reported 68 None None None None e2452\nq4_total_revenue_growth_estimate {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'year-over-year revenue growth', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q4'} source third_party 0.65 None None None None e5162\nq4_total_revenue_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q4'} computed forecast 112.2 None None apply_growth ['q4_total_revenue_prior_year', 'q4_total_revenue_growth_estimate'] None\nq4_dc_revenue_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 Q4'} computed forecast 103.785 None None product ['q4_total_revenue_forecast', 'dc_mix_q2'] None\ndc_fy27_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027'} computed forecast 373.115 None None sum ['dc_q1_fy27', 'dc_q2_fy27', 'q3_dc_revenue_forecast', 'q4_dc_revenue_forecast'] None\ndc_fy27_reference {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027'} source third_party 361 None None None None e2295\nQUOTE 6 e2295 'Nvidia’s DC business has achieved exponential growth already, rising from $3 billion in fiscal 2020 to $194 billion in fiscal 2026, and we estimate it will be $361 billion in fiscal 2027, representing 86% annual growth.'\n8 ('pair-old-2', 'joint')\ntotal_q1 {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q1'} source reported 81.6 None None None None NVIDIA reported fiscal Q1 2027 total revenue of $81.6 billion.\ndc_q1 {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 Q1'} source reported 75.25 None None None None NVIDIA’s Data Center segment generated $75.25 billion in FY2027 Q1.\ntotal_q2 {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q2'} source reported 96.2 None None None None NVIDIA reported Q2 FY2027 revenue of $96.2 billion.\ndc_q2 {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 Q2'} source reported 89 None None None None NVIDIA reported Q2 FY2027 Data Center revenue of $89.0 billion.\nq3_guidance {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'} source guidance 108 None None None None NVIDIA guided Q3 FY2027 revenue to $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%.\nq3_beat_history {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'average revenue above guidance high end', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'past four quarters'} source third_party 3.1 None None None None Over the past four quarters, actual revenue has averaged 3.1% above the high end of guidance.\nq3_total_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'} estimate forecast 113.6 None None None ['q3_guidance', 'q3_beat_history'] My estimate: the recurring guidance-beat evidence applied to the $110.16 billion guidance high end points near the independent $113–$114 billion Q3 forecast.\nq4_growth_rate {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'sequential revenue growth', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3 guidance midpoint versus Q2'} source guidance 12 None None None None Q3 FY2027 revenue guidance was up 12% sequentially at the midpoint.\nq4_total_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q4'} estimate forecast 127.2 None None None ['q3_total_forecast', 'q4_growth_rate'] My estimate carries the 12% sequential growth pace implied by Q3 guidance forward from the estimated Q3 result; NVIDIA also said hyperscale growth should reaccelerate in Q4 as Vera Rubin supply builds.\nfy27_total_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027'} computed forecast 418.6 None None sum ['total_q1', 'total_q2', 'q3_total_forecast', 'q4_total_forecast'] None\nfy27_total_consensus {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027'} source third_party 411 None None None None Wall Street analysts expect NVIDIA total revenue of $411 billion in FY2027.\ndc_mix_proxy {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'Data Center share of company revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q2'} source third_party 92.5 None None None None Data Center revenue was 92.5% of total revenue in FY2027 Q2.\nq3_dc_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'} estimate forecast 105.08 None None product ['q3_total_forecast', 'dc_mix_proxy'] My estimate applies the latest reported Data Center mix to estimated Q3 company revenue.\nq4_dc_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 Q4'} estimate forecast 117.66 None None product ['q4_total_forecast', 'dc_mix_proxy'] My estimate applies the latest reported Data Center mix to estimated Q4 company revenue.\nfy27_dc_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027'} computed forecast 386.99 None None sum ['dc_q1', 'dc_q2', 'q3_dc_forecast', 'q4_dc_forecast'] None\nfy27_dc_reference {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027'} computed forecast 380.175 None None product ['fy27_total_consensus', 'dc_mix_proxy'] None\n10 ('pair-old-2', 'separate-v14')\nfy27_q1_actual {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q1'} source reported 81.6 None None None None e238\nQUOTE 10 e238 'For the first quarter of fiscal 2027, revenue jumped 85% year-over-year (YOY) to $81.6 billion, easily beating analyst expectations.'\nfy27_q2_actual {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q2'} source reported 96.2 None None None None e2497\nQUOTE 10 e2497 'NVIDIA (NASDAQ: NVDA) today reported revenue for the second quarter ended July 26, 2026, of $96.2 billion, up 18% from the previous quarter and up 106% from a year ago.'\nfy27_h1_actual {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 first half'} computed forecast 177.8 None None sum ['fy27_q1_actual', 'fy27_q2_actual'] None\nfy27_q3_guidance {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'} source guidance 108.0 None None None None e2499\nQUOTE 10 e2499 'Revenue is expected to be $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%. NVIDIA is not assuming any Data Center compute revenue from China in its outlook.'\nfy27_q3_guidance_high {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'} computed forecast 110.16 None None range_from_relative ['fy27_q3_guidance'] None\nrecent_guidance_beat {'population': 'NVIDIA revenue guidance', 'measure': 'average actual revenue above guidance high end', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'past four quarters'} source third_party 3.1 None None None None e4762\nQUOTE 10 e4762 'Nvidia has exceeded the high end of its revenue guidance in each of the past 12 quarters. Over the past four quarters, actual revenue has averaged 3.1% above the high end of guidance.'\nfy27_q3_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'} computed forecast 113.6 None None product ['fy27_q3_guidance_high', 'recent_guidance_beat'] None\nfy27_q3_analyst_estimate {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'} source third_party None None None None None e4761\nQUOTE 10 e4761 'However, I think Nvidia could report third-quarter revenue of around $113 billion to $114 billion.'\nfy27_sequential_growth_carry {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue growth', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3 midpoint sequential growth, carried forward as Q4 assumption'} source third_party 12 None None None None e3943\nQUOTE 10 e3943 \"In the meantime, Nvidia's fiscal 2027 third-quarter guidance implies 12% sequential growth at the midpoint.\"\nfy27_q4_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q4'} computed forecast 127.2 None None roll_forward ['fy27_q3_forecast', 'fy27_sequential_growth_carry'] None\nfy27_consensus {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027'} source consensus 411 None None None None e4097\nQUOTE 10 e4097 'For FY 2027 (ending in January 2027), Wall Street analysts expect $411 billion in revenue.'\nv14_fy27_forecast {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027'} computed forecast 418.4 None None sum ['fy27_h1_actual', 'fy27_q3_forecast', 'fy27_q4_forecast'] None\n12 ('pair-old-2', 'separate-v9')\ndc_fy27_h1_reported {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 first half'} source reported 164 None None None None NVIDIA generated $164 billion in Data Center revenue in the first six months of FY2027.\ntotal_fy27_q1_reported {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q1'} source reported 81.6 None None None None NVIDIA reported fiscal Q1 2027 total revenue of $81.6 billion.\ntotal_fy27_q2_reported {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q2'} source reported 96.2 None None None None NVIDIA reported Q2 FY2027 revenue of $96.2 billion.\ntotal_fy27_q3_guidance {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'} source guidance 108 None None None None NVIDIA guided Q3 FY2027 revenue to $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%.\ntotal_fy27_consensus {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027'} source consensus 411 None None None None Wall Street analysts expect NVIDIA total revenue of $411 billion in FY2027.\ntotal_fy27_q4_implied {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q4'} computed forecast 125.2 None None difference ['total_fy27_consensus', 'total_fy27_q1_reported', 'total_fy27_q2_reported', 'total_fy27_q3_guidance'] Implied residual from FY2027 total-revenue consensus less reported Q1 and Q2 revenue and Q3 guidance.\ndc_mix_latest {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'share of company revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 Q2'} source third_party 92.5 None None None None Data Center revenue rose to 92.5% of NVIDIA total revenue in FY2027 Q